                                                "sense_id": "d9668418-5db3-3f4f-957e-a86979eda04e",
                                                "text": "Mrs Dosett, aware that daintiness was no longer within the reach of her and hers, did assent to these walkings in Kensington Gardens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf153746-e03f-4f34-a309-42211e3d9f6f",
                                                "sense_id": "d9668418-5db3-3f4f-957e-a86979eda04e",
                                                "text": "Walking seems so simple: Just put one foot in front of the other. Yet every step you take is a precarious act. When you walk, your body’s center of mass is rarely located over one of your feet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc1adbc2-5429-4678-9c65-d6598a3ad921",
                                                "sense_id": "d9668418-5db3-3f4f-957e-a86979eda04e",
                                                "text": "Turnip Rock is located in a portion of eastern Michigan dubbed the Thumb, where 140 miles of coastline and waterfront towns offer a variety of outdoor activities, including biking, walking and kayaking."
